OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 9 MAY
OL,4,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,5,     GJess is joined by folk singer-
OL,6,     Gsongwriter Olivia Chaney to swap
OL,7,     Gsome of their favourite tracks,
OL,8,     Gincluding music by Joni Mitchell,
OL,9,     GBartok, Louis Andriessen and
OL,10,     GSufjan Stevens.
OL,11,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,12,     GFrom the Metropolitan Opera in
OL,13,     GNew York, with Erin Morley in her
OL,14,     GMet debut as Marie and Lawrence
OL,15,     GBrownlee as her admirer Tonio.
OL,16,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,17,     GLopa Kothari pays tribute to the
OL,18,     Glate broadcaster Andy Kershaw;
OL,19,     Gand Fatoumata Diawara shares her
OL,20,     Gtwo Return Journey tracks: one
OL,21,     Gfor the road and one that takes
OL,22,     Gher home.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
