OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 9 MAY
OL,4,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,5,     GKate Molleson presents music from
OL,6,     GTectonics 2026, the annual
OL,7,     Gfestival curated by Ilan Volkov
OL,8,     Gand the BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,9,     GOrchestra, including a world
OL,10,     Gpremiere by Christopher Fox.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GSoloist Augustin Hadelich, the
OL,13,     GWDR Symphony Orchestra, Cologne
OL,14,     Gand conductor Krzysztof Urbanski
OL,15,     Gperform Barber's Violin Concerto.
OL,16,     GLater, Mendelssohn's 'Italian'
OL,17,     GSymphony.
